# Response headers for the deployed SPA. Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the root of
# what it publishes (public/ is copied into dist/ verbatim by Vite); after the on-prem
# move Workers Static Assets reads the same file. Matching is order-sensitive and MERGED:
# /* carries the security headers, and the asset rules below only add Cache-Control.
#
# connect-src and img-src are 'self' PLUS the R2 S3 endpoint that the presigned URLs
# point at. The SPA is same-origin by design, but the file-upload widget PUTs bytes
# DIRECTLY to the presigned URL (use-upload.ts), so that request is a fetch, not a
# navigation, and 'self' alone blocks every upload; attachments render from time-limited
# presigned GETs on the same endpoint. Every deployed environment (dev and prod) stores
# to Cloudflare R2 and connects path-style to one account-scoped S3 host — the exact host
# below, with no wildcard, so only this storage account is reachable. The host comes from
# STORAGE_ENDPOINT in gitops values/opshub/{dev,prod}.yaml; change both together. Local
# development uses the Vite dev server, which applies no CSP, so Garage needs no entry.
#
# The Caddyfile carries the same policy header-for-header (scripts/web-image-test.sh
# compares every value), and src/test/csp-storage-origin.test.ts proves the presigned
# origin is in both directives of both files.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://69e52835cf2d08edde5b6ebd741d30fa.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; font-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://69e52835cf2d08edde5b6ebd741d30fa.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; frame-src 'self' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:;
  Cache-Control: no-cache

# Content-hashed filenames: the bytes behind a given URL never change.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
